sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as Client_UI
    participant API as Petshop_API
    participant Inv as Inventory
    participant Sales as Sales_Prepaid

    UI->>API: POST grooming-appointments/complete
    API->>API: GroomingAppointment.Complete
    API->>Inv: ConsumeStockForGroomingRequest
    Inv-->>API: Result Success
    API->>Sales: ConsumePrepaidServicePackageRequest
    Note over Sales: NotFound ou saldo zero ignora
    API->>API: GroomingRecord.Finalize
    API-->>UI: 200 OK
